# Layout docs must stay in sync

`miryoku/custom_config.h` is the source of truth for layers.

After any layout change in this session:

1. Update `SETUP.md` layer diagrams and notes.
2. Update the canvas at
   `~/.cursor/projects/Users-zakcasey-Documents-projects-keyboard-miryoku-zmk/canvases/corne-layer-reference.canvas.tsx`
3. Run `python3 scripts/check-layer-docs.py` and fix any drift before you stop.

Do not leave the canvas or `SETUP.md` behind the firmware config.
See `AGENTS.md` for the full checklist.
